  "Content": {
    "Html": "<p>Show your support of NutritionFacts.org with exclusive new products in our spring fundraiser. Step into summer with our new T-shirt and tank top and enjoy your green tea with a NutritionFacts.org tumbler. They’re only available for a limited time, through May 9. </p>\n<p>All proceeds support the continued work of NutritionFacts.org. </p>\n<p> </p>\n<h4 class=\"null\">We Hit 100 Million Views!</h4>\n<div><a href=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2019/04/100-Million-IG-copy.png/\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-large wp-image-58771 alignleft\" src=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2019/04/100-Million-IG-copy-1024x1024.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\" srcset=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2019/04/100-Million-IG-copy-1024x1024.png 1024w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2019/04/100-Million-IG-copy-960x960.png 960w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2019/04/100-Million-IG-copy-768x768.png 768w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2019/04/100-Million-IG-copy-500x500.png 500w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2019/04/100-Million-IG-copy-1200x1200.png 1200w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2019/04/100-Million-IG-copy-720x720.png 720w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2019/04/100-Million-IG-copy-540x540.png 540w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 200px) 100vw, 200px\"/></a>I’m thrilled to announce NutritionFacts.org videos have now been watched 100 MILLION times. It’s an honor to continue my life’s mission of providing evidence-based information for free. On behalf of all of us at NutritionFacts.org, I thank you for watching and sharing the videos every week. </div>\n<div> </div>\n<div> </div>\n<div> </div>\n<div> </div>\n<div> </div>\n<div> </div>\n<div>\n<h4 class=\"null\">Seeking Spanish Translators</h4>\n<div><a href=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2019/04/VolunteerGraphic_IG-Spanish.png/\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-large wp-image-58779 alignleft\" src=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2019/04/VolunteerGraphic_IG-Spanish-1024x1024.png\" alt=\"Spanish volunteers needed\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\" srcset=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2019/04/VolunteerGraphic_IG-Spanish-1024x1024.png 1024w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2019/04/VolunteerGraphic_IG-Spanish-960x960.png 960w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2019/04/VolunteerGraphic_IG-Spanish-768x768.png 768w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2019/04/VolunteerGraphic_IG-Spanish-500x500.png 500w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2019/04/VolunteerGraphic_IG-Spanish-1200x1200.png 1200w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2019/04/VolunteerGraphic_IG-Spanish-720x720.png 720w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2019/04/VolunteerGraphic_IG-Spanish-540x540.png 540w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2019/04/VolunteerGraphic_IG-Spanish.png 1920w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 200px) 100vw, 200px\"/></a>Our Spanish team is looking for a few experienced translators to work on translating and editing transcripts, blog posts, and video subtitles. Applicants should be proficient in both Spanish and English, with previous translation experience and a basic understanding of NutritionFacts.org content and medical terms. To apply, go to <a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/volunteer/\">https://nutritionfacts.org/volunteer</a>.   </div>\n</div>\n<div> </div>\n<div> </div>\n<div> </div>\n<div> </div>\n<div> </div>\n<div>\n<h4 class=\"null\">Host a Screening of “How Not to Die”</h4>\n<div><a href=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2019/04/Photo-2019-03-28-8-28-12-PM.jpg/\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-image-58776 alignleft\" src=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2019/04/Photo-2019-03-28-8-28-12-PM-1024x768.jpg\" alt=\"Outreach program\" width=\"200\" height=\"150\" srcset=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2019/04/Photo-2019-03-28-8-28-12-PM-1024x768.jpg 1024w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2019/04/Photo-2019-03-28-8-28-12-PM-120x90.jpg 120w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2019/04/Photo-2019-03-28-8-28-12-PM-960x720.jpg 960w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2019/04/Photo-2019-03-28-8-28-12-PM-768x576.jpg 768w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2019/04/Photo-2019-03-28-8-28-12-PM-500x375.jpg 500w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2019/04/Photo-2019-03-28-8-28-12-PM-1200x900.jpg 1200w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2019/04/Photo-2019-03-28-8-28-12-PM-720x540.jpg 720w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2019/04/Photo-2019-03-28-8-28-12-PM-540x405.jpg 540w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 200px) 100vw, 200px\"/></a>Share the latest in evidence-based nutrition with your community by hosting a free screening of Dr. Michael Greger’s “How Not to Die” presentation in your area. We will provide a free Digital Event Kit to give you everything you need to ensure success. Last month, a volunteer hosted a screening at The University of British Columbia to over 50 attendees. Thanks, Matt! Visit our How Not to Die Events page (<a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/volunteer/screenings/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">https://nutritionfacts.org/volunteer/screenings/</a>) for more information.</div>\n</div>\n<div> </div>\n<div> </div>\n<div>\n<h4 class=\"null\">Welcome, Steven!</h4>\n<div><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-image-58774 alignleft\" src=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2019/04/bb8bc006-d5c0-48a1-95e0-a13fb3da3af0.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"193\" height=\"262\"/>Steven is our new Full-Stack Web Developer here at NutritionFacts.org. His area of expertise is full-stack development, but he brings a variety of skills and knowledge to the team. He has previously worked as a personal trainer and — in his free time — is passionate about lifting, snowboarding, and other outdoor activities. Steven lives in Austin, Texas with his girlfriend and his cat, Rambo. Meet the rest of the team <a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/team/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">here</a>.</div>\n</div>\n<div> </div>\n<div>\n<h4> </h4>\n</div>\n<h4> </h4>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<div>\n<h4 class=\"null\">Live Q&amp;As Today</h4>\n<p><a href=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2018/05/LiveQANewsletter-Square.png/\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-large wp-image-53879 alignleft\" src=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2018/05/LiveQANewsletter-Square-1024x1024.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\" srcset=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2018/05/LiveQANewsletter-Square-1024x1024.png 1024w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2018/05/LiveQANewsletter-Square-960x960.png 960w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2018/05/LiveQANewsletter-Square-768x768.png 768w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2018/05/LiveQANewsletter-Square-500x500.png 500w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2018/05/LiveQANewsletter-Square-1200x1200.png 1200w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2018/05/LiveQANewsletter-Square-720x720.png 720w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2018/05/LiveQANewsletter-Square-540x540.png 540w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2018/05/LiveQANewsletter-Square.png 2000w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 200px) 100vw, 200px\"/></a>Every month until recently I’ve done Q&amp;As live from my treadmill. Now that I’ve finished the draft of my new upcoming book, I’m excited to say the Q&amp;As are back and <em><strong>today</strong></em> is the day.</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Facebook Live</strong>: At 12:00 p.m. ET TODAY go to our <a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/NutritionFacts.org/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en&amp;q=https://nutritionfacts.us5.list-manage.com/track/click?u%3Dc1bae6687e1e6ab175fb56913%26id%3Dafe9299fd2%26e%3D545b7f785a&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1516314018432000&amp;usg=AFQjCNEIgGkyjkXIfYHCVfz6o5PQOxSkhw\">Facebook page</a> to watch live and ask questions.</li>\n<li><strong>YouTube Live Stream: </strong>At 3:00 p.m. ET TODAY go <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=cx0USAbvWqk\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en&amp;q=https://nutritionfacts.us5.list-manage.com/track/click?u%3Dc1bae6687e1e6ab175fb56913%26id%3D88539af304%26e%3D545b7f785a&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1516314018432000&amp;usg=AFQjCNEvfR6sb4jzTlryjwFO0t9k3RiaJA\">here</a> to watch live and ask even more questions! </li>\n</ul>\n<p>You can now find links to all of my past live YouTube and Facebook Q&amp;As right <a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/live/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">here</a>. If that’s not enough, remember I have an audio podcast to keep you company at <a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.us5.list-manage.com/track/click?u=c1bae6687e1e6ab175fb56913&amp;id=9c5c1ac6dc&amp;e=545b7f785a\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en&amp;q=https://nutritionfacts.us5.list-manage.com/track/click?u%3Dc1bae6687e1e6ab175fb56913%26id%3D9c5c1ac6dc%26e%3D545b7f785a&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1516314018432000&amp;usg=AFQjCNGoL2STvivkREYbL3IbSQpGMo_YSw\">https://nutritionfacts.org/audio.</a></p></div>\n<div> </div>\n<div>\n<p>In health,</p>\n<p><b>Michael Greger, M.D.</b></p>\n<p>PS: If you haven’t yet, you can subscribe to my free videos <a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/subscribe/\"><u><b>here</b></u></a><b> </b>and watch my live, year-in-review presentations:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>2012: <a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/uprooting-the-leading-causes-of-death/\"><u><b>Uprooting the Leading Causes of Death</b></u></a></li>\n<li>2013: <a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/more-than-an-apple-a-day-preventing-our-most-common-diseases/\"><u><b>More Than an Apple a Day</b></u></a></li>\n<li>2014: <a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/from-table-to-able/\"><u><b>From Table to Able: Combating Disabling Diseases with Food</b></u></a></li>\n<li>2015: <a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/food-as-medicine/\"><u><b>Food as Medicine: Preventing and Treating the Most Dreaded Diseases with Diet</b></u></a></li>\n<li>2016: <a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/how-not-to-die/\"><u><b>How Not To Die: The Role of Diet in Preventing, Arresting, and Reversing Our Top 15 Killers</b></u></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>"
